# Deliberate guard, not a leftover: docs/reference/ was emptied on 2026-07-15 (contents moved to
# /reference/). Kept ignored because DECISIONS.md #22 and #41 still cite this path, so a future
# session could recreate it from habit — and an un-ignored recreation would re-associate the public
# repo with the studied templates, the exact thing #22 paid a history rewrite to undo. Cheap insurance.
/docs/reference/
*.local.md
